{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29189","headline":"泊蒜山津闻东林寺光仪上人物故 · 许浑","name":"泊蒜山津闻东林寺光仪上人物故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云斋曾宿借方袍，因说浮生大梦劳。\n言下是非齐虎尾，宿来荣辱比鸿毛。\n孤舟千棹水犹阔，寒殿一灯夜更高。\n明日东林有谁在，不堪秋磬拂烟涛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}